        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 text-lg">A federal law tucked inside last year's government shutdown deal will ban most hemp-derived THC products in America by November 12, 2026. In Texas, that means 6,350 businesses, 40,000 jobs, and $7.5 billion in economic activity are on the clock.</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">By El Paso Cannabis Club</span>
          <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-600"></span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">6 min read</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>
</section>

